        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "BLÜCHER in Denmark now offers EPDs for its drains, channels and piping products, and we also have EPDs for underfloor heating manifolds manufactured in Landau, Germany, providing customers with vital environmental transparency data.",
        "start_character": 4649,
        "end_character": 4881
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-018541",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-018541-e081ee9ac2fe613b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-018541",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For product sales in the Americas, we rely primarily on commissioned manufacturers’ representatives to market our product lines, some of which maintain a consigned inventory of our products.",
        "start_character": 14057,
        "end_character": 14247
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-018541",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-018541-e081ee9ac2fe613b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-018541",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2024, we completed Life Cycle Assessments (“LCAs”) for all products manufactured at our largest production facility and foundry in Franklin, New Hampshire, covering many of our most impactful product lines.",
        "start_character": 4007,
        "end_character": 4216
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-018541",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-018541-e081ee9ac2fe613b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-018541",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Over the years, we have continued to bring innovation to our markets, with smart and connected advancement in our backflow product line to provide sensors for flood and freeze detection, notification, and tampering security, providing potential to avoid water loss and mitigate damage from undetected floods.",
        "start_character": 23573,
        "end_character": 23881
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-018541",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-018541-e081ee9ac2fe613b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-018541",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also sell products directly to wholesalers, OEMs and private label accounts primarily in Europe and APMEA, and, to a lesser extent, in the Americas.",
        "start_character": 14478,
        "end_character": 14629
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-018541",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-018541-e081ee9ac2fe613b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-018541",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that new product development and product engineering are also important to success in the water industry and that our position in the industry is attributable in part to our ability to develop new and innovative products quickly and to adapt and enhance existing products.",
        "start_character": 26057,
        "end_character": 26340
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-018541",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-018541-e081ee9ac2fe613b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-018541",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We cannot be certain that our efforts to develop new products will be successful or that our customers will accept our new products.",
        "start_character": 26494,
        "end_character": 26626
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-018541",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-018541-e081ee9ac2fe613b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-018541",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continue to develop new and innovative products to expand our market position and are implementing manufacturing and design programs to reduce costs.",
        "start_character": 26341,
        "end_character": 26493
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-018541",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-018541-e081ee9ac2fe613b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-018541",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continue to focus on sustainability by taking steps to reduce the negative impact our operations have on the environment while generating economic value, and we manufacture and sell solutions, products and technologies that enable our customers to reduce their negative impact on the environment.",
        "start_character": 3539,
        "end_character": 3838
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-018541",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-018541-e081ee9ac2fe613b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-018541",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We employ a global new-product development process that is used to prioritize, guide, and support new projects.",
        "start_character": 23461,
        "end_character": 23572
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-018541",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-018541-e081ee9ac2fe613b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-018541",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We focus on selling solutions to our customers that integrate a variety of our product offerings.",
        "start_character": 1778,
        "end_character": 1875
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-018541",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-018541-e081ee9ac2fe613b",
